   "value": "test20 = ToTeX[expr19, \"DifferentialNotation\" -> \"Functional\"];\nexpected20 = \"d\\\\left(z_{1}\\\\right) \\\\wedge d\\\\left(\\\\bar{z}_{2}\\\\right)\";\ntest20Result = test20 === expected20;\nPrint[\"Test 20 (functional differential): \", If[test20Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED - got \" <> test20]];\ntest20Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
